Render embedded catalog metadata only (no network, no writes, no subprocesses).

Usage:
  foundry catalog [flags]
  foundry catalog [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List embedded catalog units (core, archetypes, profiles)
  show        Show one embedded catalog unit by exact id

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for catalog

Global Flags:
      --color string    color mode: auto|always|never (text mode only) (default "auto")
      --output string   output mode: text|json (default "text")
      --quiet           suppress non-essential human output (text mode only)
      --verbose         diagnostic detail on stderr (text mode only)

Use "foundry catalog [command] --help" for more information about a command.
